                "feedbackOnCorrect": "Yes, while histamine dilates the peripheral blood vessels, adrenaline constricts them. While histamine closes off the airways, adrenaline opens them up. That is the reason that antihistamines and adrenaline are used in a type I hypersensitivity reaction.",
